#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:7
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v11.5, messages in channels with auto-translation enabled"
" are automatically translated into your preferred language. This enables "
"seamless multilingual collaboration — you can read and respond in your "
"own language while teammates do the same in theirs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:10
msgid "How auto-translation works"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:12
msgid ""
"Your system admin must first :doc:`enable auto-translation "
"</administration-guide/manage/admin/autotranslation>` for your Mattermost"
" instance. Then, a system admin or channel admin can enable it for "
"individual channels. When autotranslation is enabled in a channel:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:14
msgid "The language of each message is automatically detected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:15
msgid ""
"Messages are translated into your preferred display language and shown in"
" place of the original text."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:16
msgid "Code blocks, URLs, and @mentions are preserved and not translated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:17
msgid ""
"Translations happen asynchronously — there may be a brief delay before "
"the translated text appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:18
msgid "Messages written in your preferred language are not translated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:21
msgid "View translated messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:23
msgid ""
"Translated messages display in place of the original text. To view the "
"original untranslated message, select the **translation** icon on the "
"message."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:26
msgid "Set your preferred language"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:28
msgid ""
"Auto-translation translates messages into your Mattermost display "
"language. To change your display language:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:30
msgid "Select the gear icon to open **Settings**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:31
msgid "Select **Display > Language**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:32
msgid "Choose your preferred language."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:33
msgid "Select **Save**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:35
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`language <end-user-guide/preferences/manage-your-display-"
"options:language>` documentation for more details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:38
msgid "Opt out of auto-translation in a channel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:40
msgid ""
"You can opt out of auto-translation on a per-channel basis if you prefer "
"to see original messages in a specific channel. To opt out:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:42
msgid "Open the channel where you want to disable auto-translation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:43
msgid "Select the channel name at the top to open the channel menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:44
msgid "Disable the auto-translation option for this channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:46
msgid ""
"You'll see original, untranslated messages in that channel going forward."
" You can re-enable auto-translation at any time using the same steps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:49
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:51
msgid ""
"**Direct and group messages**: Your system admin may have restricted "
"auto-translation in direct and group messages. If auto-translation isn't "
"available in a direct or group message, contact your system admin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:52
msgid ""
"**Short or mixed-language messages**: Very short messages or messages "
"that mix multiple languages may not be reliably detected and translated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:53
msgid ""
"**Code-only messages**: Messages that contain only code blocks are not "
"translated, as code is preserved in its original form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/autotranslate-messages.rst:54
msgid ""
"**Translation accuracy**: Translation quality depends on the translation "
"provider configured by your system admin. Some languages or specialized "
"terminology may produce less accurate results."
msgstr ""

